<div class="page-head"><div class="titles"><h1>Annual stocktakes</h1><p>Plan the yearly count: date and locations, freeze, count teams, recounts, differences at cost and sign-off.</p></div></div>
<% if(locked){ %><p class="notice"><span class="badge">Growth</span> Annual stocktake work requires Growth or above. Retained results stay readable. <a class="btn" href="/settings/billing">Upgrade</a></p><% } %>
<% if(!locked){ %><p><%= runsAlone?'On Pro and Custom, StockChief runs the yearly stocktake from your rule: it freezes the chosen locations on the count date, sends each counter a blind list, asks a second counter to recount big differences, posts areas within your count limit and reopens them. Big differences wait for your sign-off.':'On Growth, StockChief prepares each stocktake plan for your approval. You start the freeze, ask for recounts and sign off the differences.' %></p><% } %>
<p>This covers up to 10,000 recorded whole-unit stock positions in up to 50 locations, including bins. A freeze stops StockChief sales, picks, receipts, transfers and stock value changes at the chosen locations until sign-off or a stop. Pause outside sales channels yourself. Tracked and measured goods use their own counts.</p>
<% if(problem){ %><p class="notice"><%= problem %></p><% } %>
<% if(selected){ const p=selected,late=p.status==='FROZEN'&&p.end_day&&p.end_day<today,counted=t=>Number(t.observed)>=Number(t.planned_positions); %>
<section class="card section"><h2><%= p.title %> · <%= p.stocktake_year %></h2>
<p><strong><%= p.status==='SIGNED_OFF'?'Signed off':p.status==='FROZEN'?(p.signoff_approved_at?'Differences approved — posting':'Stock locations frozen'):p.status==='STOPPED'?'Stopped — freeze released':'Plan ready for review' %></strong><% if(p.automatic){ %> <span class="badge">Runs on its own</span><% } %></p>
<% if(p.count_day){ %><p>Count date: <%= p.count_day %><%= p.end_day&&p.end_day!==p.count_day?' · last counting day: '+p.end_day:'' %>.<% if(p.recount_units!=null||p.recount_minor!=null){ %> Recount when a position is off by more than <%= [p.recount_units!=null?helpers.qty(p.recount_units)+' units':null,p.recount_minor!=null?helpers.money(Number(p.recount_minor),p.recount_currency):null].filter(Boolean).join(' or ') %>.<% } %></p><% } %>
<p><%= p.scope.positions.toLocaleString() %> recorded stock positions. Freeze scope: <%= p.scope.locations.map(l=>l.name).join(', ') %>.</p>
<% if(late){ %><p class="notice notice--warn">The last planned counting day has passed and these locations are still frozen. Finish the counts and sign off, or stop the stocktake.</p><% } %>
<% if(p.problem&&['DRAFT','FROZEN'].includes(p.status)){ %><p class="notice notice--warn">StockChief stopped and is waiting for you: <%= p.problem %></p><% } %>
<% if(p.status==='DRAFT'&&!locked){ %><% if(p.automatic){ %><p>StockChief freezes these locations on <%= p.count_day %>. You can also start now.</p><% } %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/<%= p.id %>/freeze" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="planHash" value="<%= p.plan_hash %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I confirm these exact locations and count teams. Freeze their stock activity and open the physical count lists.</label><button class="btn" <%= problem?'disabled':'' %>>Freeze these locations and start counting</button></form><% } %>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Count location</th><th>Counter</th><th>Positions</th><th>Physical counts recorded</th><th>Worksheet</th></tr></thead><tbody><% teams.forEach(t=>{ %><tr><td><%= t.location_name %></td><td><%= t.counter_name %></td><td><%= t.planned_positions %></td><td><%= t.observed %></td><td><%= t.status||'Ready when frozen' %><% if(t.campaign_id&&!locked){ %> · <a href="/warehouse/counts/campaigns/<%= t.campaign_id %>">Review worksheet</a><% } %></td></tr><% }); %></tbody></table></div>
<% if(p.status==='FROZEN'&&!locked){ %><p>Counters find their blind count lists in Needs you. They never see the recorded quantity. An empty location with no recorded stock positions has no count list; check unexpected goods separately.</p>
<% teams.filter(t=>t.status==='DRAFT'&&!counted(t)).forEach(t=>{ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/<%= p.id %>/reassign" class="form-stack card"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="locationId" value="<%= t.location_id %>"><label>Remaining counts at <%= t.location_name %><select name="counterId" required><% people.forEach(u=>{ %><option value="<%= u.id %>" <%= u.id===t.counter_id?'selected':'' %>><%= u.name %></option><% }); %></select></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> Assign the remaining positions. Earlier counts keep their original counter.</label><button class="btn" <%= problem?'disabled':'' %>>Reassign remaining counts</button></form><% }); %>
<% } %>
<% if(totals&&p.status!=='DRAFT'){ %><p><strong><%= totals.applied %> of <%= totals.positions %> positions applied</strong> · <%= totals.uncounted %> need counts · <%= totals.differences %> differences.</p><p>Reviewed stock value change: <%= currency&&Number.isSafeInteger(Number(totals.value_difference))?helpers.money(Number(totals.value_difference),currency):'Review each worksheet for its exact value change' %>.</p><% } %>
<% if(differences&&differences.rows.length){ const d=differences,m=v=>v==null?'Cost missing':d.currency?helpers.money(v,d.currency):'Set up the inventory currency'; %>
<h3>Differences at cost</h3>
<p><%= d.totals.differences %> <%= helpers.plural(d.totals.differences,'difference','differences') %> · <%= d.totals.posted %> posted · <%= d.totals.needsYou %> <%= d.totals.needsYou===1?'needs':'need' %> your sign-off<%= d.totals.recounting?' · '+d.totals.recounting+' being recounted':'' %>. Extra stock found: <%= m(d.totals.gainMinor) %>. Stock missing: <%= m(-d.totals.lossMinor) %>. Change still to post: <%= m(d.totals.waitingMinor) %>.</p>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Location</th><th>Product</th><th>Recorded</th><th>First count</th><th>Count</th><th>Difference</th><th>Value at cost</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><% d.rows.forEach(r=>{ %><tr><td><%= r.location_name %></td><td><%= r.code %> · <%= r.product %></td><td><%= helpers.qty(r.before_quantity) %></td><td><%= r.recounted?helpers.qty(r.first_quantity)+(r.first_counter_name?' ('+r.first_counter_name+')':''):'—' %></td><td><%= r.quantity==null?'—':helpers.qty(r.quantity) %></td><td><%= r.delta==null?'—':(r.delta>0?'+':'')+helpers.qty(r.delta) %></td><td><%= r.delta==null?'—':m(r.valueMinor) %></td><td><%= r.status %></td></tr><% }); %></tbody></table></div>
<% if(d.more){ %><p><%= d.more %> more differences are on the area worksheets.</p><% } %>
<% } %>
<% if(p.status==='FROZEN'&&!locked&&!p.signoff_approved_at){ teams.filter(t=>t.status==='DRAFT'&&counted(t)&&differences&&differences.rows.some(r=>r.location_id===t.location_id&&!r.recounted&&!r.applied_at&&r.delta)).forEach(t=>{ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/<%= p.id %>/recount" class="form-stack card"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="locationId" value="<%= t.location_id %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> Ask a second counter for a blind recount of the differences at <%= t.location_name %><%= p.recount_units!=null||p.recount_minor!=null?' that are over your recount limit':'' %>.</label><button class="btn" <%= problem?'disabled':'' %>>Ask for a recount at <%= t.location_name %></button></form><% });} %>
<% if(p.status==='FROZEN'&&!locked){teams.filter(t=>t.status==='REVIEW_REQUIRED').forEach(t=>{ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/<%= p.id %>/recheck" class="form-stack card"><h3>Recheck <%= t.location_name %></h3><p><%= t.problem||'This worksheet needs owner review.' %></p><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="locationId" value="<%= t.location_id %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="physicallyRechecked" value="yes" required> I physically rechecked the remaining recorded counts.</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> Reopen this worksheet for individual review. Completed adjustments stay posted.</label><button class="btn" <%= problem?'disabled':'' %>>Reopen these rechecked counts</button></form><% });} %>
<% if(p.status==='FROZEN'&&p.signoff_approved_at){ %><p>You approved the differences. They are posting to stock and the books; the freeze lifts when every area has posted.</p><% } %>
<% if(p.status==='FROZEN'&&!locked&&!p.signoff_approved_at&&teams.length&&!teams.every(t=>t.status==='COMPLETED')&&teams.every(t=>t.status!=='REVIEW_REQUIRED'&&(t.status!=='DRAFT'||counted(t)))){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/<%= p.id %>/approve" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="reviewHash" value="<%= differences?differences.hash:'' %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I reviewed every difference above. Post them to stock and the books at cost, then sign off and lift the freeze.</label><button class="btn" <%= problem?'disabled':'' %>>Approve differences and sign off</button></form><% } %>
<% if(p.status==='FROZEN'&&!locked&&!p.signoff_approved_at&&teams.every(t=>t.status==='COMPLETED')){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/<%= p.id %>/signoff" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="reviewHash" value="<%= reviewHash %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I reviewed these completed physical counts and stock value changes. Sign off this stocktake and release the freeze.</label><button class="btn" <%= problem?'disabled':'' %>>Sign off and release the freeze</button></form><% } %>
<% if(['DRAFT','FROZEN'].includes(p.status)){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/<%= p.id %>/stop" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> Stop this stocktake and release its freeze. Completed adjustments remain posted; remaining count work stops.</label><button class="btn">Stop stocktake and release freeze</button></form><% } %>
<% if(p.signed_off_at){ %><p>Signed off <%= helpers.dateTime(p.signed_off_at) %>.<%= p.signoff&&p.signoff.agent?' StockChief closed it on its own: every difference was within your count limit.':'' %></p><% } %>
</section>
<% }else if(!locked){ const r=rule; %>
<section class="card section"><h2>Yearly stocktake</h2>
<% if(r){ %><p>Next count: <strong><%= r.countDate %></strong> for <%= r.countDays %> day<%= r.countDays===1?'':'s' %>, planned <%= r.noticeDays %> day<%= r.noticeDays===1?'':'s' %> ahead. Recount when a position is off by more than <%= [r.recountUnits!=null?helpers.qty(r.recountUnits)+' units':null,r.recountMinor!=null?helpers.money(r.recountMinor,r.currency):null].filter(Boolean).join(' or ') %>.</p><% if(r.lastIssue){ %><p class="notice notice--warn">StockChief could not plan it: <%= r.lastIssue %></p><% } %><% }else{ %><p>Save the date, locations and team once. StockChief plans the stocktake ahead every year.</p><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/rule" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= r?r.revision:0 %>">
<label class="rm-field"><span>Stocktake name</span><input name="title" value="<%= r?r.title:'Annual stocktake' %>" maxlength="160" required></label>
<div class="field-row field-row--3"><label class="rm-field"><span>Count date</span><input type="date" name="countDate" value="<%= r?r.countDate:'' %>" min="<%= today %>" required></label><label class="rm-field"><span>Counting days</span><input type="number" name="countDays" min="1" max="31" step="1" value="<%= r?r.countDays:1 %>" required></label><label class="rm-field"><span>Plan this many days ahead</span><input type="number" name="noticeDays" min="0" max="90" step="1" value="<%= r?r.noticeDays:7 %>" required></label></div>
<fieldset><legend>Locations to count</legend><p class="hint">Choose warehouses, areas or single bins. A warehouse includes its bins.</p><% locations.forEach(l=>{ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="ruleLocationIds" value="<%= l.id %>" <%= r&&r.locations.includes(l.id)?'checked':'' %>> <%= l.name %></label><% }); %></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Count team</legend><p class="hint">Areas are shared out by size, within each person's warehouse access.</p><% people.forEach(u=>{ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="ruleCounterIds" value="<%= u.id %>" <%= r&&r.counters.includes(u.id)?'checked':'' %>> <%= u.name %></label><% }); %></fieldset>
<div class="field-row"><label class="rm-field"><span>Recount when off by more than (units)</span><input type="number" name="recountUnits" min="0" step="any" value="<%= r&&r.recountUnits!=null?r.recountUnits:'' %>"></label><label class="rm-field"><span>…or by more than (value at cost<%= currency?', '+currency:'' %>)</span><input name="recountValue" inputmode="decimal" value="<%= r?r.recountValue:'' %>"></label></div>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> <%= runsAlone?'Let StockChief run this stocktake every year inside these settings. Big differences still need my sign-off.':'Prepare this stocktake plan for my approval every year.' %></label>
<button class="btn">Save yearly stocktake</button></form>
<% if(r){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/rule" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= r.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="remove" value="yes"><button class="btn">Remove yearly stocktake rule</button></form><% } %>
</section>
<section class="card section"><h2>Prepare a count plan</h2><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="requestKey" value="<%= requestKey %>"><label>Stocktake name<input name="title" value="Annual stocktake" maxlength="160" required></label><label>Year<input type="number" name="year" value="<%= year %>" min="2000" max="2200" required></label><div class="field-row"><label class="rm-field"><span>Count date (optional)</span><input type="date" name="countDate" min="<%= today %>"></label><label class="rm-field"><span>Counting days</span><input type="number" name="countDays" min="1" max="31" step="1"></label></div><fieldset><legend>Stock locations to include</legend><p>Choosing a warehouse includes its existing bins.</p><% locations.forEach(l=>{ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="locationIds" value="<%= l.id %>"> <%= l.name %></label><% }); %></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Count team</legend><p>Recorded positions are shared among your selected counters within their existing warehouse access.</p><% people.forEach(u=>{ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="counterIds" value="<%= u.id %>"> <%= u.name %></label><% }); %></fieldset><div class="field-row"><label class="rm-field"><span>Recount when off by more than (units, optional)</span><input type="number" name="recountUnits" min="0" step="any"></label><label class="rm-field"><span>…or by more than (value at cost, optional)</span><input name="recountValue" inputmode="decimal"></label></div><button class="btn" <%= problem?'disabled':'' %>>Prepare this stocktake plan</button></form></section><% } %>
<section class="card section"><h2><%= filterStatus==='FROZEN'?'Your frozen stocktakes':'Your stocktakes' %></h2><form method="get" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes"><label>Show stocktakes<select name="status"><option value="">All plans</option><option value="DRAFT" <%= filterStatus==='DRAFT'?'selected':'' %>>Ready for review</option><option value="FROZEN" <%= filterStatus==='FROZEN'?'selected':'' %>>Frozen</option><option value="SIGNED_OFF" <%= filterStatus==='SIGNED_OFF'?'selected':'' %>>Signed off</option><option value="STOPPED" <%= filterStatus==='STOPPED'?'selected':'' %>>Stopped</option></select></label><button class="btn">Show these stocktakes</button></form><% if(!rows.length){ %><p>No stocktake plans yet.</p><% } %><% rows.forEach(r=>{ %><p><a href="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/<%= r.id %>"><%= r.title %> · <%= r.stocktake_year %></a> · <%= {DRAFT:'Ready for review',FROZEN:'Frozen',SIGNED_OFF:'Signed off',STOPPED:'Stopped'}[r.status]||r.status %></p><% }); %><% if(page>1){ %><a href="?page=<%= page-1 %>&amp;status=<%= filterStatus||'' %>">Previous page</a><% } %><% if(more){ %><a href="?page=<%= page+1 %>&amp;status=<%= filterStatus||'' %>">Next page</a><% } %><% if(selected&&!locked){ %><p><a href="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes">Plan another stocktake</a></p><% } %></section>
<p>AI credits used: 0. Plans use your recorded stock and team permissions.</p>
